<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_18> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 160(2) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word “refundable” the words “, except as may be specified by the Commission”. Amendment of section 201"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_19> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
