<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_22__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) Subject to section 219, an acquirer who has obtained control in a company shall make a take-over offer for the remaining voting shares in accordance with the provisions of the Code, guidelines, directions, practice notes and any ruling issued by the Commission.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
