<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_29__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: “(4) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(d), where a person who was responsible for preparing the disclosure document or prospectus, or for conducting the due diligence of the information or statement contained in the disclosure document or prospectus is an individual acting on behalf of his principal, the loss or damage may only be recoverable from the principal.”. Substitution of section 256"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
