<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_46__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Capital Markets and Services (Prescription of Islamic Securities) Order 2012 [P.U. (A) 478/2012] and the Capital Markets and Services (Prescription of Capital Market Product) (Islamic Capital Market Product) Order 2012 [P.U. (A) 479/2012] are revoked with effect from the effective date. Saving and transitional"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
