<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An electronic facility registered under subsection 34(1) of the principal Act before the effective date shall, from that date, be deemed to be a recognized market under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
