<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any condition or restriction imposed on such electronic facility shall be deemed to be a condition or restriction to its registration under subsection 34(1) as introduced by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
