<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@/~cl_49__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Unless otherwise notified in writing by the Commission, an application for registration as an electronic facility that is pending immediately before the effective date shall be deemed to be an application for a registration as a recognized market operator."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/16/eng@> .
